.TH rayscan-distributed-worker 1  "worker " 
.SH NAME
rayscan\-distributed\-worker \- Poll a coordinator, execute assigned shard scans, and submit the reports
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBworker\fR <\fB\-\-coordinator\fR> [\fB\-\-token\fR] [\fB\-\-name\fR] [\fB\-\-ca\-cert\fR] [\fB\-\-insecure\-tls\fR] [\fB\-\-once\fR] [\fB\-\-max\-jobs\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Poll a coordinator, execute assigned shard scans, and submit the reports
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-coordinator\fR \fI<URL>\fR
Coordinator base URL, for example http://10.0.0.5:9090 or https://10.0.0.5:9090
.TP
\fB\-\-token\fR \fI<TOKEN>\fR
Bearer token (or RAYSCAN_DISTRIBUTED_TOKEN), at least 16 characters
.TP
\fB\-\-name\fR \fI<NAME>\fR
Worker display name (defaults to the hostname)
.TP
\fB\-\-ca\-cert\fR \fI<FILE>\fR
PEM CA bundle used to verify the coordinator\*(Aqs HTTPS certificate
.TP
\fB\-\-insecure\-tls\fR
Accept any coordinator HTTPS certificate. Use only for testing
.TP
\fB\-\-once\fR
Claim and run a single job, then exit
.TP
\fB\-\-max\-jobs\fR \fI<N>\fR [default: 0]
Stop after N jobs (0 means unlimited)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
